  "notes": "AFMA convention: <=3Y quarterly Act/365F vs 3M BBSW (ADSWAPxQ quotes); >3Y semi-annual Act/365F vs 6M BBSW. T+1 settle. Use '3s'/'6s' in a command to force the index. NABZ (NAB) source resolves but published no API prices on this terminal - entitlement may be required. FRA strip added 2026-07 (composite-only full securities) to shape the front end between swap pillars; FRAs whose maturity clashes with a quoted pillar are skipped by the bootstrapper. FWCM: q/q curve S0303 for legs ENDING <=3y (and explicit qq tags); s/s S0302 beyond (and explicit ss) - 2026-07. q/q band extended 5Y-9Y with the real ADSWAP5Q..9Q quotes 2026-08-04 (a q/q leg ending past the band fell onto the mixed curve, whose 3Y-q/4Y-s splice books the ~26bp 3s6s basis as a forward cliff - H30-1Y read +48bp vs FWCM). ADSWAP10Q and beyond are ALIASES of the SA (VS 6M) quotes (NAME says so) - never wire them."
